710103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":3610726434,"text":"また何か貴重なものを見つけたの？見せてくれるかしら？","nextNodeIds":[722710104]},{"nodeId":722710104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3589648122,"text":"龍骨花の露玉のことを琳琅に伝えた。","nextNodeIds":[722710105]},{"nodeId":722710105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1682563410,"text":"あなたの言う通りなら、これはとんでもなく古い物になるわね。","nextNodeIds":[722710106]},{"nodeId":722710106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1360316314,"text":"ただ…少し見てみたけど、特別なところは何もなかったわ。長期的に使ってみないと判断が難しいかも…","nextNodeIds":[722710107]},{"nodeId":722710107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":3496189066,"text":"私の感覚では、少し誇張されているように感じるわね。それに…失敗した者の言い訳に過ぎない可能性もありえる…","nextNodeIds":[722710108]},{"nodeId":722710108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":3559677866,"text":"あっ、気にしないで。深く考えずに言っただけだから、聞き流してちょうだい。","nextNodeIds":[722710122]},{"nodeId":722710122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":2020093250,"text":"骨董品の業界において、こういうのは至って普通のことよ。","nextNodeIds":[722710109]},{"nodeId":722710109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":3300812178,"text":"それよりも、密封状態で保存してなかったみたいね。表面に少し傷がついてるわ。","nextNodeIds":[722710110]},{"nodeId":722710110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1952445314,"text":"これだと、値段も少し落ちるわよ。","nextNodeIds":[722710123]},{"nodeId":722710123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1239646730,"text":"八万モラならどう？それに加えて、オリジナル料理の実り豊かを五つおまけするわ。","nextNodeIds":[722710111]},{"nodeId":722710111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":684586658,"text":"結構いい値段だと思うわ。","nextNodeIds":[722710112,722710116,722710119]},{"nodeId":722710112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":529481266,"text":"これをどんなことに使うか教えて。","nextNodeIds":[722710113]},{"nodeId":722710113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":282403946,"text":"私はこれの効果よりも、その背景にある物語のほうに価値を感じているの。","nextNodeIds":[722710114]},{"nodeId":722710114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":333014722,"text":"港にいる講談師や歌劇家、それから玉京台にいる貴人たちに、興味を持ってもらえると思うわ。","nextNodeIds":[722710115]},{"nodeId":722710115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1467992082,"text":"それか、店の受け付けに貴重な骨董品の一つとして展示できるわね。","nextNodeIds":[722710111]},{"nodeId":722710116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3270216082,"text":"適正な価格だと思う、交渉成立。","nextNodeIds":[722710117]},{"nodeId":722710117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1275085770,"text":"決断が早いわね、モラを受け取ってちょうだい。","nextNodeIds":[722710118]},{"nodeId":722710118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":1211037602,"text":"もし今後もこのようなお宝があったら、いつでも歓迎するわよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722710119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":57180562,"text":"少し考えさせて。","nextNodeIds":[722710120]},{"nodeId":722710120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":3867950762,"text":"ええ、貴重なお宝だから、慎重に考えるのも当然のことよ。","nextNodeIds":[722710121]},{"nodeId":722710121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2023,"speakerName":"琳琅","textMapHash":894867578,"text":"考えがまとまったら、また声をかけてちょうだい。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7227102,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":true,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param